# RESETIUS |   Angle 8
# RESETIUS |   Axiom FXY++F++FXY++F
# RESETIUS |   X=XY@Q2-F@IQ2-FXY++F++FXY
# RESETIUS |   Y=-@Q2F-@IQ2FXY
# RESETIUS |   }
#
# Original Fractint 20.04p17 official rule library:
# FRACTINT | Peano2 { ; Adrian Mariano
# FRACTINT | ; from The Fractal Geometry of Nature by Mandelbrot
# FRACTINT |   Angle 8
# FRACTINT |   Axiom FXY++F++FXY++F
# FRACTINT |   X=XY@Q2-F@IQ2-FXY++F++FXY
# FRACTINT |   Y=-@Q2F-@IQ2FXY
# FRACTINT |   }
